{"esoteric":{"id":"68fb6f6a-bad4-4f66-81d8-ad7c52fd55f4","word":"esoteric","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"understood only by a chosen few","word":"esotérico"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"having to do with concepts that are highly theoretical","word":"esotérico"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"confidential; private","word":"confidencial"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"confidential; private","word":"secreto"}],"pos":"adj","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"The writing in this manual is very esoteric; I’d need a degree in engineering just to understand it!","bold_text_offsets":[[35,43]],"type":"example","id":"3f06bf17-10ea-4123-9906-7a69f3626726"},{"text":"In this situation Hitler availed himself of a time-honored device-the use of esoteric language. In all periods of history, when government or society has put limits on public discussion, those who wish to circumvent censorship resort to the use of esoteric language. Exoterically understood, the text is unexceptionable, but to the insiders who know how to interpret the words, the message is revolutionary and dangerous to the status quo.","ref":"1975, Lucy S. Dawidowicz, The War Against the Jews 1933-1945:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[77,85],[248,256]],"id":"3db1a90c-b129-45f1-85f9-5df5cd77afc3"}],"links":[["enlightened","enlightened"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"arcane"},{"word":"recondite"},{"word":"acroamatic"}],"antonyms":[{"word":"exoteric"}],"categories":["English terms with quotations","English terms with usage examples"],"glosses":["Intended for or likely to be understood by only a small number of people with a specialized knowledge or interest, or an enlightened inner circle."],"id":"3f2c7cd7-47f8-444c-b0f4-438baea5e281"},{"examples":[{"text":"When he spoke to me of esoteric mysteries I wanted to say to him,\"Don't give me that spiritual hokum, friend!\"","ref":"1976 September, Saul Bellow, Humboldt’s Gift, New York, N.Y.: Avon Books, →ISBN, page 278:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[23,31]],"id":"fd47a7b0-9d69-4377-aae0-98d1ced8d234"}],"links":[["concept","concept"],["theoretical","theoretical"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"cerebral"}],"glosses":["Having to do with concepts that are highly theoretical and without obvious practical application; often with mystical or religious connotations."],"categories":["English terms with quotations"],"id":"80ef60ca-7610-4420-a8ed-4af6a28bac6a"},{"examples":[{"text":"an esoteric purpose","bold_text_offsets":[[3,11]],"type":"example","id":"524340cc-eec3-4a74-a8e3-8bd56239bbc0"},{"text":"an esoteric meeting","bold_text_offsets":[[3,11]],"type":"example","id":"ba459572-b010-483f-aa53-6ada2740d3de"}],"links":[["Confidential","confidential"],["private","private"]],"synonyms":[{"word":"secretive"}],"glosses":["Confidential; private."],"categories":["English terms with usage examples"],"id":"7a0255ac-76d8-413b-a9c2-b84ca660ab69"}],"related":[{"word":"esoterica"},{"word":"esoterically"},{"word":"esotericism"},{"word":"esotericist"},{"word":"esoterism"},{"word":"exoteric"},{"word":"exotericism"},{"word":"exoterism"}],"synonyms":[]},"esophageal":{"id":"d98c7822-5333-4187-9a1f-edaf06cdffb7","word":"esophageal","trans":[{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"pertaining to the esophagus","word":"esofágico"},{"lang":"Portuguese","code":"pt","lang_code":"pt","sense":"pertaining to the esophagus","word":"esofagiano"}],"pos":"adj","tags":null,"senses":[{"examples":[{"text":"Recently, activation of Wnt signaling has been reported efficient for intestinalization of human esophageal keratinocytes in vitro [20].","ref":"2015 August 18, Orestis Lyros et al., “Wnt/β-Catenin Signaling Activation beyond Robust Nuclear β-Catenin Accumulation in Nondysplastic Barrett’s Esophagus: Regulation via Dickkopf-112”, in Neoplasia (New York, N.Y.), volume 17, →DOI:","type":"quotation","bold_text_offsets":[[97